@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` receives an asynchronous instruction loader and requests `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md`. The runtime must supply that canonical content unchanged at the factory boundary.
+
+The factory fixes the agent ID to `order-triage`, the action to `classify-for-human-review`, and refund approval to `false`. This repository does not define a provider, model invocation, tools, or executable order and classification schemas.
